# `bun.lock` is the lockfile this repo tracks, and the one Lovable syncs.
# `npm install` is only the documented way in (see HANDOFF.md §3, the install
# trap), so the lockfile it drops on the way is a local artefact, not a second
# source of truth.
package-lock.json
